From: sisma66 at tiscali.it (Pierluig De Rosa)
Date: Wed Nov 14 16:58:14 2007
Subject: [STATSGRASS] 2 script to perform kriging interpolation (v.variogram and v.krige)
Message-ID: <200603311310.09901.sisma66@tiscali.it>

Dear all grass users,
We have written to scripts to perform kriging surface interpolation.
The first one v.variogram create an omnidirectional experimental variogram.
The v.krige script perform a surface kriging interpolation using an 
exponential variogram model. The model parameter (nugget, sill and range) are 
desumend from experimental semi-variogram produced by v.variogram.
If you wont to try, go to the wiki grass page:
http://grass.gdf-hannover.de/twiki/bin/view/GRASS/GrassAddOns#Vector_add_ons 

All two scripts needs R software to be installed on your machine.

Thanks to all
